To navigate between the CDs in the example above, create a 
next() and previous() function:

Example

function next()
{
  // display the next CD, unless you are on the last CD

if (i < len-1) {

    i++;

    displayCD(i);

  }

}

function previous()
{
  // display the previous CD, unless you are on the first CD 

if (i > 0) {

    i--;

    displayCD(i);

  }

}

